; json-crosspool-mutate.no — KNOWN-BUG 最小复现（审计 §5.3）
;
; 状态：预期失败（expected-fail）。**故意不接入 CI**（CI 的 corpus-smoke 只 `build`
;       不 `run`，本档可正常编译；std-test 不引用本档）。仅作为回归锚点，
;       待 `src/std/json.no` 的跨池 builder 修复后，本档应转为全部 PASS。
;
; 复现的缺陷（baked bin/no @ adc925d4 实测）：
;   1. arr-push：把来自**另一个 pool** 的 json 值 push 进目标数组，返回 ok=true
;      但目标数组看不到该元素（子节点索引未 copy-tree 进目标池 → 悬空索引）。
;      源码根因：src/std/json.no:1336 `arr-push = (val json){ ok = .arr-push-idx(val.root) }`
;      直接把 `val.root`（val 自己池里的索引）交给 `.pool.add-child`，缺跨池 copy-tree。
;   2. set-key / delete-key：对 `json.parse(...)` 建的接收者同样静默不改动。
;   3. （附注）对 `json.new()`（null 根 root=-1）调用 arr-push 会 SIGSEGV，
;      故本档不复现崩溃路径，只锁死「静默 no-op」这条可稳定观测的路径。
;
; 执行：no run tests/json-crosspool-mutate.no

; ── case 1: 跨池 arr-push 应当让目标数组增长 ──────────────────
a = json.parse('[1,2]')
len_before = a.arr-len()
pushed = a.arr-push(json.parse('3'))
len_after = a.arr-len()
s_after = a.stringify()

print('case1 arr-push cross-pool:')
print('  push returned ok =', pushed, '(expect 1)')
print('  arr-len before/after =', len_before, '/', len_after, '(expect 2 / 3)')
print('  stringify =', s_after, '(expect [1,2,3])')
{
    len_after == 3 -> print('  => PASS')

    -> print('  => FAIL (KNOWN BUG §5.3: element lost, cross-pool index not copied)')
}

; ── case 2: set-key 对 parse 建的接收者应当新增键 ──────────────
o = json.parse('{"x":1}')
len_before2 = o.obj-len()
ok2 = o.set-key('y', json.parse('2'))
len_after2 = o.obj-len()
s2 = o.stringify()

print('case2 set-key on parse receiver:')
print('  set-key returned ok =', ok2, '(expect 1)')
print('  obj-len before/after =', len_before2, '/', len_after2, '(expect 1 / 2)')
print('  stringify =', s2, '(expect {"x":1,"y":2})')
{
    len_after2 == 2 -> print('  => PASS')

    -> print('  => FAIL (KNOWN BUG §5.3: key not visible on parse-built receiver)')
}

; ── case 3: delete-key 对 parse 建的接收者应当移除键 ────────────
d = json.parse('{"a":1,"b":2}')
len_before3 = d.obj-len()
ok3 = d.delete-key('a')
len_after3 = d.obj-len()

print('case3 delete-key on parse receiver:')
print('  delete-key returned ok =', ok3, '(expect 1)')
print('  obj-len before/after =', len_before3, '/', len_after3, '(expect 2 / 1)')
{
    len_after3 == 1 -> print('  => PASS')

    -> print('  => FAIL (KNOWN BUG §5.3: key not removed on parse-built receiver)')
}

print('DONE — any FAIL above is the tracked §5.3 defect, not a new regression.')
